// # Unified Autonomous Vehicle Model Predictive Control (MPC) Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 submodules across vehicle dynamics, tire models, QP solvers, NMPC, path tracking, and active safety.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API providing single-import access to the complete openOODA Model Predictive Control and Vehicle Dynamics stack.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular kinematics, dynamics, tire mechanics, numerical solvers, NMPC, path tracking, safety filters, and chassis control submodules.
//   2. Re-export public vehicle configurations, factory constructors, and controller shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA autonomous vehicle control applications.
//   4. Expose high-level autonomous driving executive and unified vehicle controller system factory.

